contentText:
Lizzo returned Friday (June ) with her first album in four years, BITCH , hitting streaming services. Shortly after the project&#8217;s arrival, the Detroit native shared an alternate edition of the LP&#8217;s title track, which seemingly finds her taking aim at Nicki Minaj.

